:: Deadwood Transport Road Fight
<<set _road_events to maplebirch.get('Transport').events>>
<<if _road_events.combatPending>>
  <<set _cab_encounter to $Transport.trip.event.kind is 'molestation', _police_encounter to $Transport.trip.event.kind is 'police'>>
  <<if _cab_encounter>><<run maplebirch.get('Transport').taxi.passengerNPC()>><</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _cab_encounter>>
        You pull over and switch off the engine. As you turn to push the hand away, the passenger grabs your wrist. <<He>> leans into the front seat, pressing you against the door.
        <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').taxi.state.job.people gt 1>>The other passengers scramble out of the car.<</if>>
      <<elseif _police_encounter>>
        <<if $Transport.trip.event.caught>>The police car blocks your path. You brake and climb out as two officers close in.
        <<else>>You leave the vehicle and shove an officer's reaching hand away. The other steps forward with a pair of handcuffs.<</if>>
        "Stop resisting."
        <<if $Transport.trip.passengers.length>>You tell your companion to stay back.<</if>>
      <<elseif $Transport.trip.event.caught>>
        A hand catches you before you clear the gap. You brake hard. By the time you can get moving again, someone has dragged you away from the vehicle.
      <<else>>
        You stop, <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').model.kind is 'bicycle'>>keeping hold of the handlebars<<else>>keeping the keys in your hand<</if>>. "Move." The figure in front lunges for you while the other circles behind.
      <</if>>
      <<if !_cab_encounter and !_police_encounter>>You brace yourself against the edge of the road.
      <<if $Transport.trip.taxi is 'dropoff'>>Your passenger scrambles back along the verge, out of reach of the two figures.
      <<elseif $Transport.trip.passengers.length>>You shout for your companion to stay back. There is barely room between you and the two figures.<</if>>
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _cab_encounter>>
        你靠边停车，关掉发动机。刚转身去推那只手，乘客就攥住了你的手腕。<<He>>探进前座，把你挤向车门。
        <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').taxi.state.job.people gt 1>>其余乘客慌忙下了车。<</if>>
      <<elseif _police_encounter>>
        <<if $Transport.trip.event.caught>>警车挡住了去路。你刹车，下了车。两名警员朝你逼近。
        <<else>>你下了车，推开警员伸来的手。另一名警员拿着手铐走上前。<</if>>
        “别再反抗。”
        <<if $Transport.trip.passengers.length>>你让同行的人退开。<</if>>
      <<elseif $Transport.trip.event.caught>>
        你还没穿过空隙，一只手就伸了过来。你急忙刹车，还没来得及重新出发，就被人拖离了载具。
      <<else>>
        你停下，<<if maplebirch.get('Transport').model.kind is 'bicycle'>>握紧车把<<else>>把钥匙攥在手里<</if>>。“让开。”前面的人朝你扑来，另一个绕到了你身后。
      <</if>>
      <<if !_cab_encounter and !_police_encounter>>你站稳脚步，背后就是路沿。
      <<if $Transport.trip.taxi is 'dropoff'>>乘客慌忙沿路肩往后退，躲开那两个人。
      <<elseif $Transport.trip.passengers.length>>你喊同行的人先退开。你和那两个人之间，几乎没有容人挤过的空隙。<</if>>
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<run _road_events.beginCombat()>>
<</if>>
<<if _road_events.inCombat and $combat>>
  <<effects>><<effectsman>><<alarmstate>><<man>><<stateman>>
  <br><br><<actionsman>>
  <<if _combatend or _road_events.combatComplete>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Transport Road Fight Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <<else>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Transport Road Fight'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood Transport Travel'>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Transport Road Fight Finish
<<set _road_events to maplebirch.get('Transport').events>>
<<if _road_events.inCombat and $combat>>
  <<effects>>
  <<if _road_events.combatComplete and $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>><<ejaculation "short">><</if>>
  <<run _road_events.finishCombat()>>
<</if>>
<<if _road_events.policeArrested>>
  <<deadwood-transport-hazard-result>>
  <<skinicon 'manacles'>><<lanLink ['Be taken to the station', '被带往警局'] 'Deadwood Transport Police Handover'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif _road_events.inCombat>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Transport Road Fight'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $Transport.trip?.event?.combat is 'finished'>>
  <<deadwood-transport-hazard-result>>
  <<if $Transport.trip.interrupted>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').taxi.active>>
      <<icon 'transport/dispatch-radio.png'>><<lanLink ['Contact dispatch', '联系调度'] 'Deadwood Transport Taxi Dispatch'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Continue on foot', '步行离开'] $Transport.return_passage>>
      <<set $Transport.trip to null>>
    <</lanLink>>
  <<else>>
    <<icon `'transport/' + maplebirch.get('Transport').model.id + '.png'`>><<lanLink ['Continue the journey', '继续行程'] 'Deadwood Transport Travel'>><</lanLink>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return', '返回'] $Transport.return_passage>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>


:: Deadwood Transport Police Handover
<<set _road_events to maplebirch.get('Transport').events>>
<<if _road_events.policeArrested>>
  <<if !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$combat and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
    <<set $location to 'police_station', $outside to 0>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The officers take you to the station on Barb Street. At reception, one hands over a report while the other leads you downstairs. Your vehicle remains where you stopped; it has not been confiscated.
      The cell door closes behind you. An officer tells you to wait while they process the case.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      警员把你带到警察局。一人在前台递交记录，另一人领着你下楼。你的载具留在停车的地方，没有被没收。
      牢门在身后关上。警员让你等着，等他们处理你的案子。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <!-- 只消费本次移交；不走自首减刑，也不销毁手持物。 -->
  <<skinicon 'manacles'>><<lanLink ['Wait (1:00)', '等待 (1:00)']>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').events.policeArrested and !$Transport.trip.event.handover and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$combat and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
      <<set $Transport.trip.event.handover to true>>
      <<set _road_bounty to maplebirch.get('StreetLife')?.bounties, _road_case to _road_bounty?.state.active>>
      <<if _road_case?.stage is 'escort' and _road_case.vehicle is $Transport.trip.vehicle>>
        <<if $per_npc[_road_case.key]>><<clearNPC _road_case.key>><</if>>
        <<set _road_bounty.state.last to { id: _road_case.id, outcome: 'interrupted', fee: 0 }, _road_bounty.state.active to null>>
      <</if>>
      <<endevent>><<pass 60>>
      <<if $passage is 'Deadwood Transport Police Handover' and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$combat and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <!-- 警员已确认身份，不应用潜行减免；保证原版处理时至少有一天社区服务。 -->
        <<if crimeSumCurrent() lt 200>>
          <<set _road_charge to Math.ceil(200 - crimeSumCurrent())>>
          <<set C.crime.petty += _road_charge, C.crime.pettyHistory += _road_charge, C.crime.pettyDaily += _road_charge>>
          <<set C.crime.pettyCount += 1, C.crime.pettyCountHistory += 1>>
          <<if $averyCrimeTracker neq null>><<set $averyCrimeTracker += _road_charge>><</if>>
        <</if>>
        <<goto 'Police Cell'>>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is no pending arrest to process.' '目前没有等待处理的拘捕记录。'>><br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to reception', '返回前台'] 'Police Station'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
